  "hard_rules": [
    "Never omit authority/scope for a task that could change semantics.",
    "Never include stale evidence as current proof.",
    "Never promote CANDIDATE implementation refs to exact without reading them.",
    "For physical robotics claims, include physical-evidence requirement even if no physical evidence exists.",
    "When unresolved conflict affects requested decision, pack must expose CONFLICT rather than choose silently."
